C.7  ADVERSARIAL -- THE DECOMPOSITION IS UNIQUE, NOT MERELY CONSISTENT
     any other symmetric/antisymmetric split of A is shown impossible:
     D' = D + E with E symmetric forces S' = S - E antisymmetric,
     which forces E = 0.  Tested on perturbations of every boundary.

    PASS  no alternative symmetric/antisymmetric split exists   94/94

